<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>Endurance 90 L10 - Tempo 3x15 @ 85%</name>
    <description>PICK THIS WHEN: Tempo-flavoured endurance: counts as a MEDIUM day, not an easy one. Do not place it the day before a hard session. The 90-minute set is for the long ride of the week; ride one level below your 60-minute endurance level if in doubt.
DAY TYPE: Easy to medium.

Endurance 90 - level 10 of 10. Tempo 3x15 @ 85%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 10 min @ 65%, 15 min @ 85%, 5 min @ 65%, 15 min @ 85%, 5 min @ 65%, 15 min @ 85%, 10 min @ 62%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Three 15-minute tempo blocks. The hardest endurance session in the library. Eat 40-60 g of carbohydrate per hour on rides this long.

Estimated TSS: 82.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="Endurance"/>
        <tag name="Level 10"/>
        <tag name="90 min"/>
    </tags>
    <workout>
        <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.45" PowerHigh="0.60">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Long endurance ride: 90 minutes. Warm up easy and settle into a relaxed rhythm. Have food and drink within reach."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="480" message="2 minutes to the main set."/>
        </Warmup>
        <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.65">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="10 min at 65% - easy. Drink."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="900" Power="0.85">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Tempo: 15 min at 85%. Controlled, rhythmic, not hard."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="450" message="Halfway through this tempo block. Relax the upper body."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.65">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="5 min at 65% - easy. Drink."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="900" Power="0.85">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Tempo: 15 min at 85%. Controlled, rhythmic, not hard."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="450" message="Halfway through this tempo block. Relax the upper body."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.65">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="5 min at 65% - easy. Drink."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="900" Power="0.85">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Tempo: 15 min at 85%. Controlled, rhythmic, not hard."/>
            <textevent timeoffset="450" message="Halfway through this tempo block. Relax the upper body."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.62">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Main set done. 10 min of easy Zone 2 to finish."/>
        </SteadyState>
        <Cooldown Duration="300" PowerLow="0.58" PowerHigh="0.45">
            <textevent timeoffset="0" message="Well done - 90 minutes in the bank. Cool down easy."/>
        </Cooldown>
    </workout>
</workout_file>
